        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You somehow ended up inside a labyrinth in the night where some mysterious creatures are hunting you down, you are not the first one to get there as some people left some notes probably before dying. Luckily you brought some stones with you, they do not seem to be useful against these monsters but you could use them to orient yourself while you try to get out the labyrinth. the monsters are very different from each other, but it's up to you to understand the differences. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically the game is a labyrinth exploration puzzle  survival game (there are also stealth and resourse management involved) this game is quite hard so do not buy it if you are looking for something relaxing (you also risk an heart attack like me for the jump scares :)), but if you like challenges this game could be worth the dollar you spent on it. It is my very first game so do not expect high quality animations, that is also why i put it at 1 dollar.</p>",
